# 8. Core packages

## `packages/agent-kernel`

Stable domain package.

```text
packages/agent-kernel/src/
├── domain/
│   ├── task-spec.ts
│   ├── agent-profile.ts
│   ├── task-run.ts
│   ├── run-event.ts
│   ├── artifact.ts
│   ├── approval.ts
│   ├── memory-candidate.ts
│   ├── work-lock.ts
│   └── policy-decision.ts
├── services/
│   ├── task-service.ts
│   ├── run-service.ts
│   ├── agent-service.ts
│   ├── artifact-service.ts
│   ├── approval-service.ts
│   └── lock-service.ts
└── ports/
    ├── runtime-adapter.ts
    ├── mcp-router.ts
    ├── event-bus.ts
    ├── policy-engine.ts
    ├── memory-store.ts
    └── task-graph.ts
```

Rule: this package cannot import Claude, Codex, MCP implementation, Beads CLI, GitHub, Daytona, or E2B directly. It only defines contracts.

