## `packages/agent-runtimes`

Adapters for all execution agents.

```text
packages/agent-runtimes/src/
├── runtime-adapter.ts
├── runtime-events.ts
├── adapters/
│   ├── claude-code-adapter.ts
│   ├── codex-adapter.ts
│   ├── recoder-code-adapter.ts
│   ├── opencode-adapter.ts
│   ├── qwen-code-adapter.ts
│   ├── gemini-cli-adapter.ts
│   ├── openclaw-adapter.ts
│   ├── langgraph-adapter.ts
│   ├── autogen-adapter.ts
│   ├── crewai-adapter.ts
│   └── browser-agent-adapter.ts
└── index.ts
```

Single interface:

```ts
export interface RuntimeAdapter {
  id: string;
  kind: string;

  health(): Promise<RuntimeHealth>;
  capabilities(): Promise<AgentCapability[]>;

  sendTask(input: {
    task: TaskSpec;
    bundle: InstructionBundle;
    worktree: WorktreeRef;
    policy: RuntimePolicy;
  }): AsyncIterable<RunEvent>;

  cancel(runId: string): Promise<void>;
}
```

