# 14. Launch gate

Do not launch “everything.”

Launch this loop:

```text
1. Import Beads/GitHub task.
2. Git Nexus builds context.
3. PAL chooses Claude/Codex plan.
4. Recoder compiles InstructionBundle.
5. Claude Code implements.
6. Codex reviews or generates tests.
7. Playwright MCP verifies preview.
8. Recoder captures artifacts.
9. Human approves.
10. Beads/GitHub/PM update.
11. Memory candidate is proposed.
```

This proves the Agent OS.

