# 15. First task spec to give Claude/Codex

```yaml
title: "Recoder Agent OS: wire Beads, Git Nexus, PAL, MCP into prompt compiler foundation"
intent: platform_hardening
repo: caelum0x/recoder.xyz

goal: >
  Create the first Agent OS foundation so Recoder uses its existing OSS stack
  as one system. Manual prompting should become a fallback; Recoder should
