constraints:
  - keep first PR small
  - do not rewrite existing runtime adapters yet
  - no production behavior change
  - no hardcoded secrets or production URLs
  - every OSS component must declare contract, path, health check, and owner
  - compiler MVP can use placeholder loaders where implementation is not ready
  - InstructionBundle must include provenance and verification commands

verification:
  - pnpm format
  - pnpm check-types
  - pnpm test
  - pnpm oss:health
  - pnpm agent:instructions:check

acceptance:
  - A sample Beads-style task maps to TaskSpec.
  - PAL returns a runtime/skill/tool plan.
  - Git Nexus returns a placeholder ContextPack.
  - Compiler creates deterministic Claude and Codex InstructionBundles.
  - InstructionBundle lists source refs: Beads, Git Nexus, PAL, AGENTS.md, policy, verification.
  - Docs explain how Recoder uses all existing OSS as one Agent OS.
