# 3. The canonical Recoder contracts

Every piece above should speak at least one of these contracts.

```text
TaskSpec
AgentProfile
PALPlan
ContextPack
InstructionBundle
RuntimeAdapter
McpToolCall
A2ATaskEnvelope
RunEvent
Artifact
ApprovalRequest
MemoryCandidate
WorkLock
PolicyDecision
OSSComponentDescriptor
```

That is the real unification layer.

Instead of saying:

```text
Beads does one thing,
Git Nexus does another,
PAL does another,
Claude does another,
Codex does another.
```

Say:

```text
Beads emits TaskSpec.
Git Nexus emits ContextPack.
PAL emits PALPlan.
Instruction compiler emits InstructionBundle.
Runtimes emit RunEvent.
Tools emit McpToolCall.
Everything emits Artifact and AuditLog.
```

